title: JessicaStart
---
<<declare $npcName4 = "Jessica">> //The NPC's name will go here and can be different for each NPC if needed

{$npcName4}: Oh, sorry, I was deep in thought looking through the exhibit. A lot of good and a lot of bad. Really makes you think huh? Well, that's history for you.
-> <i>Ask about their day</i>
    <<jump JessicaDay>>
-> <i>Back to the lobby</i>
===

title: JessicaDay
---
{$npcName4}: My teacher asked us to do a research project, so I decided to research the civil war. I'm learning a lot here and can't wait to put all this information together. I'm hoping to get a good grade. Wish me luck.
-> What do you like about the museum?
    <<jump JessicaGood>>
-> Did you see the memory tree yet?
    <<jump JessicaNeutral>>
-> Good luck.
    <<jump JessicaBad>>
===

title: JessicaGood
---
{$npcName4}: I really like the tree. So many memories tied on its branches that tell so many stories with different viewpoints.
===

title: JessicaNeutral
---
{$npcName4}: I did! It really is a beautiful tree. I wonder how it got here.
===

title: JessicaBad
---
{$npcName4}: Thanks! I hope my teacher will like what I come up with.
===